er.singstat.gov.sg/view-api/for-developers">Developer API</a>, making it faster and easier to connect your applications to our data.</p></div><button class="notification__close" aria-label="Close Notification" tabindex="0" role="button"><span>Close</span></button></div></div></div></div></div><div class="notification__footer container"><div class="swiper-pagination swiper-pagination--notification"></div><div class="notification__buttons"><div class="swiper-button-prev" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Previous slide"></div><div class="swiper-button-next" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Next slide"></div></div></div></div></header></div></div><div class="main-content content-wrapper"><div class="placeholder-main"><div class="welcome-banner"><div class="container"><div class="welcome-banner__mini-title">Welcome to the</div></div><div class="welcome-banner__title"><div class="title-with-line"><div class="container"><h1 class="text-h2">Singapore Department of Statistics</h1></div></div></div><div class="container container__accent-image"><img src="/files/7a8d33fb-ed8d-4f44-9bc0-65be3c2c5471.svg" alt="Skyline for Header" class="welcome-banner__accent-image" fetchPriority="high"/></div><div class="welcome-banner__card"><div class="container"><div class="content-tabs" data-active="0"><div class="content-tabs__header"><div class="content-tabs__header__scroll-container"><a class="tab-title is-active" href="#" tabindex="0"><span>Economy &amp; Prices</span></a><a class="tab-title " href="#" tabindex="0"><span>Industry</span></a><a class="tab-title " href="#" tabindex="0"><span>Trade &amp; Investment</span></a><a class="tab-title " href="#" tabindex="0"><span>Population</span></a><a class="tab-title " href="#" tabindex="0"><span>Households</span></a><a class="tab-title " href="#" tabindex="0"><span>Society</span></a></div></div><div class="content-tabs__contents"><div class="content-tabs__contents__item active" data-index="0" aria-hidden="false" tabindex="0" style=