ew data table</span></a></div></div></div></div><div class="indicator-list__footer"><a class="btn--ghost" href="/find-data/explore-data-themes/society" role="button" aria-label="View all subjects in Society" tabindex="-1"><span>View all subjects in Society</span><div class="btn--icon-round animate-icon"><i class="icon-arrow-right"></i></div></a><img src="/files/6fe216ad-ad51-4176-a9eb-2b3849ef3aca.svg" class="indicator-list__footer__image" alt="Nature Protection 3  Streamline Brooklyn.svg" fetchPriority="high"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div><section class="data-tools-and-service"><div class="container"><div class="data-tools--left"><img src="/files/530bbf3f-23cf-4258-9667-aa405a6c729a.png" alt="Data Tools and Services" class="" loading="lazy"/><div class="text-h2">Our Data Tools and Services</div></div><div class="accordion__group"><div class="accordion__item" data-open="false"><div class="accordion__header"><div class="text-h4 accordion__title">SingStat Table Builder</div><div class="accordion__trigger"><button class="button btn--icon-only btn--round btn--no-border" aria-label="Toggle Accordion"><svg class="btn--open lucide lucide-minus-icon lucide-minus" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path></svg><svg class="btn--close lucide lucide-plus-icon lucide-plus" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="accordion__content-wrap" style="display:none"><div class="accordion__content accordion__grid-image"><img src="/files/5c43dc67-0d95-467b-ac9b-806ff5a82982.png" alt="SingStat Table Builder" class="accordion-image" loading="lazy"/><div><p>Access some 2,800 customisable datasets from 70 public sector agencies with close to 180,000 data series on economic and socio-demographic domains.</p><a href="https://tablebuilder.singstat.gov.sg/">Find out more</a></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion__item" data-open="false"><div class="accordion__header"><div class="text-h4 accordion__title">Chat with Statistics ANd Data Retrieval A.I. assistant (SANDRA) </div><div class="accordion__trigger"><button class="button btn--icon-only btn--round btn--no-border" aria-label="Toggle Accordion"><svg class="btn--open lucide lucide-minus-icon lucide-minus" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path></svg><svg class="btn--close lucide lucide-plus-icon lucide-plus" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="accordion__content-wrap" style="display:none"><div class="accordion__content accordion__grid-image"><img src="/files/494a60dc-f416-4a00-a859-e48a2c3e7caa.png" alt="Chat with Statistics ANd Data Retrieval A.I. assistant (SANDRA) " class="accordion-image" loading="lazy"/><div><p>Get assistance on data on Singapore's economy and socio-demography using semantic search and Large Language Models. </p><a href="https://www.singstat.gov.sg/chatwithsandra-beta">Find out more</a></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion__item" data-open="true"><div class="accordion__header"><div class="text-h4 accordion__title">SingStat Model Context Protocol (MCP)</div><div class="accordion__trigger"><button class="button btn--icon-only btn--round btn--no-border" aria-label="Toggle Accordion"><svg class="btn--open lucide lucide-minus-icon lucide-minus" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path></svg><svg class="btn--close lucide lucide-plus-icon lucide-plus" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="accordion__content-wrap" style="display:block"><div class="accordion__content accordion__grid-image"><img src="/files/9cc73add-bc81-4cba-a62d-c9e26ba754bf.png" alt="SingStat Model Context Protocol (MCP)" class="accordion-image" loading="lazy"/><div><p>Gain AI-ready access to Singapore’s official data through the SingStat MCP. It enables query and retrieval of Singapore’s official data while using other AI chatbots and AI-powered applications.</p><a href="/data-tools-services/singstat-mcp">Find out more</a></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion__item" data-open="false"><div class="accordion__header"><div class="text-h4 accordion__title">Business Insights Tool for Enterprises (BITE)</div><div class="accordion__trigger"><button class="button btn--icon-only btn--round btn--no-border" aria-label="Toggle Accordion"><svg class="btn--open lucide lucide-minus-icon lucide-minus" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path></svg><svg class="btn--close lucide lucide-plus-icon lucide-plus" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="accordion__content-wrap" style="display:none"><div class="accordion__content accordion__grid-image"><img src="/files/88fce5ff-9ad0-47f2-81c0-2e4d08cc5ba2.png" alt="Business Insights Tool for Enterprises (BITE)" class="accordion-image" loading="lazy"/><div><p>Gain insights on customers, industry and business performance through interactive dashboards and benchmark my performance tool. </p><a href="/data-tools-services/business-insights-tool-for-enterprises-bite">Find out more</a></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion__item" data-open="false"><div class="accordion__header"><div class="text-h4 accordion__title">Singapore Standard Occupational Classification (SSOC) Search</div><div class="accordion__trigger"><button class="button btn--icon-only btn--round btn--no-border" aria-label="Toggle Accordion"><svg class="btn--open lucide lucide-minus-icon lucide-minus" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path></svg><svg class="btn--close lucide lucide-plus-icon lucide-plus" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="accordion__content-wrap" style="display:none"><div class="accordion__content accordion__grid-image"><img src="/files/03d96d4a-3071-4772-8431-cc6a980680e2.png" alt="Singapore Standard Occupational Classification (SSOC) Search" class="accordion-image" loading="lazy"/><div><p>Search occupational codes based on Singapore Standard Occupational Classification (SSOC 2024) edition. </p><a href="/standard-classifications/national-classifications/singapore-standard-occupational-classification-ssoc/ssoc-search">Find out more</a></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion__item" data-open="false"><div class="accordion__header"><div class="text-h4 accordion__title">Anonymised Microdata Access Programme (AMAP) </div><div class="accordion__trigger"><button class="button btn--icon-only btn--round btn--no-border" aria-label="Toggle Accordion"><svg class="btn--open lucide lucide-minus-icon lucide-minus" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path></svg><svg class="btn--close lucide lucide-plus-icon lucide-plus" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="accordion__content-wrap" style="display:none"><div class="accordion__content accordion__grid-image"><img src="/files/8eff7117-ab51-4749-a2bb-c0d8179507ac.png" alt="Anonymised Microdata Access Programme (AMAP) " class="accordion-image" loading="lazy"/><div><p>Access anonymised microdata in secure settings. Researchers holding full-time appointments at Singapore's Autonomous Universities can apply. </p><a href="/data-tools-services/anonymised-microdata-access-programme-amap">Find out more</a></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion__item" data-open="false"><div class="accordion__header"><div class="text-h4 accordion__title">Participating in Our Surveys </div><div class="accordion__trigger"><button class="button btn--icon-only btn--round btn--no-border" aria-label="Toggle Accordion"><svg class="btn--open lucide lucide-minus-icon lucide-minus" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path></svg><svg class="btn--close lucide lucide-plus-icon lucide-plus" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="accordion__content-wrap" style="display:none"><div class="accordion__content "><div><p>Browse the list of major surveys of businesses and households conducted by DOS and other public sector agencies. </p><a href="/data-tools-services/participate-in-our-surveys">Find out more</a></div></div></div></div><div class="accordion__item" data-open="false"><div class="accordion__header"><div class="text-h4 accordion__title">Sampling Services for Household Survey</div><div class="accordion__trigger"><button class="button btn--icon-only btn--round btn--no-border" aria-label="Toggle Accordion"><svg class="btn--open lucide lucide-minus-icon lucide-minus" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path></svg><svg class="btn--close lucide lucide-plus-icon lucide-plus" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M12 5v14"></path></svg></button></div></div><div class="accordion__content-wrap" style="display:none"><div class="accordion__content "><div><p>Get assistance on sample design and selection at a charge.</p><a href="/data-tools-services/sampling-service-for-household-surveys">Find out more</a></div></div></div></div></div></div></section></div><section class="news-listing"><div class="container"><div style="text-align:center;padding:40px;color:#666">Loading...</div></div></section><section class="is-lilac" id="let-us-explain"><div class="content-listing"><div class="container"><h2 class="content-listing__title">Let Us Explain</h2><div class="content-listing__list"><div class="content-item"><div class="image-box"><img src="/files/3bb883cc-107c-472f-9412-5a6441172862.png" alt="Let Us Explain   How Are Population Estimates Compiled" class="" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="content-item__content"><a class="content-item__content__title" href="/files/8268fb2f-6c43-493a-84dc-580d9f80ff76.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="text-h4">How Are Population Estimates Compiled?</span></a><p>Learn about the importance of population estimates and how it is compiled in Singapore.</p></div></div><div class="content-item"><div class="image-box"><img src="/files/51f67dcb-b10f-4fbe-80f5-3d28bdc4e4f2.png" alt="Let Us Explain   Personal Disposable Income Vs Household Market Income" class="" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="content-item__content"><a class="content-item__content__title" href="/files/3018444e-ec2c-4b3f-836a-5126ad1bb9c1.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="text-h4">Personal Disposable Income vs Household Market Income</span></a><p>What are the key differences between Personal Disposable Income and Household Market Income?</p></div></div><div class="content-item"><div class="image-box"><img src="/files/1bc0b5f1-7670-4fe3-926d-1f687f9b1a1e.png" alt="let-us-explain_why-does-the-reported-inflation-differ-from-my-personal-experience" class="" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="content-item__content"><a class="content-item__content__title" href="/files/ec333809-011c-48f1-8807-7ef816c9bae4.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="text-h4">CPI Explained</span></a><p>Why does the reported inflation differ from my personal experience?</p></div></div><div class="content-item"><div class="image-box"><img src="/files/0c3e8430-87c7-4d01-a3d1-eeb068a5892f.png" alt="Shrinkflation Explained 1" class="" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="content-item__content"><a class="content-item__content__title" href="/files/61144ec7-2081-4da1-91ae-56a5ccb36ea5.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="text-h4">What is Shrinkflation?</span></a><p>An explanation of hidden price increases with examples of products most affected by shrinkflation.</p></div></div><div class="content-item"><div class="image-box"><img src="/files/391a460d-d409-4d61-b2a0-aee0cc731d2e.png" alt="let-us-explain_how-does-internationalisation-contribute-to-sg" class="" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="content-item__content"><a class="content-item__content__title" href="/files/f6616ac6-ce6b-468b-ac93-3c026e5c5dea.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="text-h4">Growing Beyond Borders</span></a><p>How does internationalisation contribute to Singapore?</p></div></div><div class="content-item"><div class="image-box"><img src="/files/82efd65d-81a6-40c6-8479-66955b3f88cc.png" alt="Output-based GDP Explained" class="" loading="lazy"/></div><div class="content-item__content"><a class="content-item__content__title" href="/files/23278488-7b33-4c23-a4fe-a9f78f00d413.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span class="text-h4">The Role of Trade in Economic Growth</span></a><p>Find out how trade plays a vital role in shaping Singapore’s economic landscape.</p></div></div></div><div class="mt-5"><a class="btn--ghost news-listing__bottom-section__corner-btn" role="button" aria-label="View all Explainers" target="_self" href="/publication-resources?resourceType=Videos%7C%7C%7CInfographics"><img alt="View all Explainers Icon" loading="lazy" width="80" height="80" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="/files/9003e696-bdc2-43a0-838d-25f123cac573.svg"/><span>View all Explainers</span><div class="btn--icon-round animate-icon"><i class="icon-arrow-right"></i></div></a></div></div></div></section></div></div><button class="button btn--blue btn--icon-only btn--back-to-top btn--back-to-top--hidden" aria-label="Back to Top"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-chevron-up-icon lucide-chevron-up"><path d="m18 15-6-6-6 6"></path></svg></button><div class="footer"><div class="placeholder-footer"><footer class="footer"><div class="footer__top"><div class="container"><div class="text-h3">Singapore Department of Statistics</div><div class="footer__content"><ul class="footer__link-group"><li><a class="footer__link" href="/who-we-are/contact-us-statistical-enquiries" target="_self"><span>Contact Us</span></a></li><li><a class="footer__link" href="https://form.gov.sg/636851c4e097ce00112046e5" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><span>Feedback</span><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="17" viewBox="0 0 16 17" fill="none"><g clip-path="url(#clip0_1173_48777)"><path d="M12.5716 8.71427V13.8571C12.5716 14.1602 12.4512 14.451 12.2369 14.6652C12.0226 14.8795 11.7319 15 11.4288 15H2.28592C1.98282 15 1.69213 14.8795 1.4778 14.6652C1.26348 14.451 1.14307 14.1602 1.14307 13.8571V4.71427C1.14307 4.41116 1.26348 4.12047 1.4778 3.90614C1.69213 3.69182 1.98282 3.57141 2.28592 3.57141H7.42878" stroke="white" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M10.8574 1.28571H14.8574V5.28571" stroke="white" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path><path d="M14.8575 1.28571L8.57178 7.57142" stroke="white" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"></path></g><defs><clipPath id="clip0_1173_48777"><rect width="16" height="16" fill="white" transform="translate(0 0.142853)"></rect></clipPath></defs></svg></a></li><li><a class="footer__link" href="/sitemap" target="_self"><span>Sitemap</span></a></li></ul><div class="footer__social"><div><div class="footer__social">
