ion (SSOC) Search\",\"description\":\"Search occupational codes based on Singapore Standard Occupational Classification (SSOC 2024) edition. \",\"logo\":\"03d96d4a-3071-4772-8431-cc6a980680e2\",\"link\":{\"type\":\"internal\",\"url\":\"\",\"internal_id\":\"ce3e3578-780b-427e-a023-2a0c6c712ea4\",\"internal_label\":\"SSOC Search\",\"fieldType\":\"InputLink\",\"collection_source\":\"xtr_cms_pages\"},\"label_link\":\"Find out more\",\"sort\":1,\"is_opened\":false,\"url_type\":\"url\"},{\"title\":\"Anonymised Microdata Access Programme (AMAP) \",\"description\":\"Access anonymised microdata in secure settings. Researchers holding full-time appointments at Singapore's Autonomous Universities can apply. \",\"logo\":\"8eff7117-ab51-4749-a2bb-c0d8179507ac\",\"link\":{\"type\":\"internal\",\"url\":\"\",\"internal_id\":\"bd1e1846-d869-4070-8963-4cfe3ff28479\",\"internal_label\":\"Anonymised Microdata Access Programme (AMAP)\",\"fieldType\":\"InputLink\",\"collection_source\":\"xtr_cms_pages\"},\"label_link\":\"Find out more\",\"sort\":1,\"is_opened\":false,\"url_type\":\"url\"},{\"title\":\"Participating in Our Surveys \",\"description\":\"Browse the list of major surveys of businesses and households conducted by DOS and other public sector agencies. \",\"logo\":\"\",\"link\":{\"type\":\"internal\",\"url\":\"\",\"internal_id\":\"40f7389b-1c11-45e7-9665-0d7990c68003\",\"internal_label\":\"Participate in our surveys\",\"fieldType\":\"InputLink\",\"collection_source\":\"xtr_cms_pages\"},\"label_link\":\"Find out more\",\"sort\":1,\"is_opened\":false,\"url_type\":\"url\"},{\"title\":\"Sampling Services for Household Survey\",\"description\":\"Get assistance on sample design and selection at a charge.\",\"logo\":\"\",\"link\":{\"type\":\"internal\",\"url\":\"\",\"internal_id\":\"da5d24b3-0db7-4bf7-93f9-3f294cea5da7\",\"internal_label\":\"Sampling Service for Household Surveys\",\"fieldType\":\"InputLink\",\"collection_source\":\"xtr_cms_pages\"},\"label_link\":\"Find out more\",\"s